  "authoringNote": "Partial S3 snapshot (D5 unusable correction). f13x2-order v1 is a valid final order. v2 has case-scoped metadata, trusted supersedes {f13x2-order, 1}, access restricted, a null contentHash and no payload. Under C08 a restricted superseder does not revoke the edge, so v1 is superseded and not current, and the only current order is restricted. R03 is restricted with R03.order_restricted naming f13x2-order v2 and R04 is restricted with R04.order_restricted naming f13x2-order v2, each for the authorization_coordinator; each C07 parent is [f13x2-order v2] because the held candidate condition has the finding status. There is no R03 or R04 no_usable_order: the current unavailable candidate explains the gap (C09). R05 is missing for the authorization_coordinator (needs_information) with R05.no_usable_order and no refs; its parent is empty. The receipt is usable, so there is no no_usable_receipt. R09 is restricted with R09.access_restricted naming f13x2-order v2, parent [f13x2-order v2]. Each restricted condition routes to the authorization_coordinator with effect needs_information. R02 passes: v2 binds by metadata only and has no body to read. R01 passes citing only the seven supplier fields (no current usable order code exists to compare). R02 cites the encounter and receipt beneficiary name and identifier (4). R03 cites nothing. R04 cites only the final encounter status, date and practitioner identifier (3). R05 cites the receipt reference and receivedAt (3) although the version it references is superseded; this is the receipt value, not an order fact. R06 five, R07 one. Vector 7,4,0,3,3,5,1. v1 is never reactivated and contributes no fact or citation. R06 is manual_review for the qualified_clinical_reviewer with R06.clinical_review (no refs, effect none) and cites the five /clinical/ statements of the usable encounter; R07 passes citing /lcmpReport/incorporated (false; the null evaluationDate is not cited); R08 passes; R10 is not_applicable with R10.pure_assessment. clinicalReviewRequired is true. Every other parent is empty. Superseded [f13x2-order v1]; quarantine empty. State needs_information. Recorded reading: a rule cites evidence-field facts only from the documents it reads, and R04 reads only final current usable records; every usable encounter and order here is final, so no draft is excluded. Deferred to S4: arrival-order recovery, history display, replay and rollback prevention are not exercised, and a neutral request for the existing order is a later workflow action.",
